{
  "id": 8833336115399,
  "title": "Fantasy Fire Dragon Quilt Set with Glowing Lava And Bedroom Setting",
  "handle": "fantasy-fire-dragon-comforter-set-with-glowing-lava-and-bedroom-setting-c7ca9ae893-c7ca9ae893",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring a touch of mythical wonder to your bedroom with the Custom Dragon Bedding Set by Jeminise. This cozy and personalized quilt set features a captivating fire dragon fantasy theme, making it an ideal choice for kids, teens, and fantasy animal lovers of all ages.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Custom options allow you to personalize this bedding set with one custom text input, such as a name or special request.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fictional Fantasy Theme:</strong> Decorated with a vibrant fire dragon fantasy motif, perfect for adding a touch of adventure to any bedroom setting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Breathable Material:</strong> Crafted from a soft microfiber and cotton-polyester blend, designed for comfort and breathability during all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Suitable for a variety of bed sizes, including Twin, Full, Queen, and King options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pillowcase Customization:</strong> Tailor your bedding set by selecting the quilt size with an option to include 2 matching pillowcases (20''x30'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This bedding set is fully machine washable for effortless cleaning and maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Recommended for daily bedroom decor, cozy lounging, and napping.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Cotton-Polyester Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragon Quilt D8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Dragon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Galaxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
